## English summary (non-binding)

This software is **source-available, not open source**. Copyright is retained
in full by the author, Sebastian Bisaga.

Permission is granted, free of charge, to **run and use** the software for
tournaments of the Polish Mölkky Federation and for local Mölkky leagues and
tournaments held in Poland. Modification, redistribution, sublicensing and
self-hosting are **not permitted** without prior written consent. Any other
use, including commercial use and deployments outside Poland, requires a
separate written agreement with the author.

As an exception (clause 1a), the Polish Mölkky Federation may keep its own
copy of the software at any time, and may run its own public deployment of
that copy — without further consent — if the author's deployment stays down
for 14 days, if the author stops maintaining the software for six months,
during the notice period after the author revokes permission, or if the author
dies or becomes permanently unable to run the project. That right covers the
changes needed to operate the deployment, but not new feature development.

Third-party trademarks and artwork contained in this repository (including
federation and club logos) are excluded from this licence.

The permission in the paragraph above remains in force until revoked by the
author in writing, subject to six months' notice. The software is provided
"as is", without warranty of any kind. Polish law applies.
